{"id":"13bb07e29169cadd","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter6 Generated Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter — ZFC Filter6 Generated Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter — ZFC Filter6 Generated Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter — ZFC Filter6 Generated Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e13f8d7f11bb676\" href=\"?note=8e13f8d7f11bb676\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, base, and generated filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6GeneratedFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6GeneratedFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (filter-base predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e13f8d7f11bb676\" href=\"?note=8e13f8d7f11bb676\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}generated\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6GeneratedFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X)\\land \\mathcal F=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}generated\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6GeneratedFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X)\\land \\mathcal F=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC filter definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md","status":"resolved","id":"8e13f8d7f11bb676","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md","status":"resolved","id":"8e13f8d7f11bb676","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (filter-base predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter-base.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6GeneratedFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}generated\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6GeneratedFilter}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X)\\land \\mathcal F=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":978,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1904","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter6-generated-filter]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8e13f8d7f11bb676"]}